# 5.8 live toggles: voice off stops act and captions before listen; perf off stops it; 6DoF is a restart toggle
# and is refused (applies at the next start); perf on starts it again.
start desk voice
at 10 cmd toggle voice off
expect 11 ran stop voice.act
expect 20 ran stop voice.captions
expect 20 ran stop voice.listen
at 30 cmd toggle perf off
expect 33 ran stop perf
at 40 cmd toggle sixdof off
expect 45 health broker ok
at 50 cmd toggle perf on
expect 53 ran start perf
expect 60 overall ok
